<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4529" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλο-φρονέω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλόφρων</span>) 
			Ep.
		 and 
			Ion.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>think of other
				things, give no heed,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλ᾽ ἥμην ἀλλοφρονέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					10.374
				</span></i>
			; of one in a swoon, <i>to be senseless,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κὰδ δ᾽ ἀλλοφρονέοντα . . εἷσαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					23.698
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεῖτ᾽ ἀλλοφρονέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					22.129
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1009b30
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ τούτων ἀλλοφρονῆσαι</span>
			<i>were seized with frenzy</i> by reason of the thunder, etc.,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.85
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλύει καὶ ἀ. ὑπὸ τῆς ὀδύνης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Morb.</u>
					2.16
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.41
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>to be of another mind, have other views,</i>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.205
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
